<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cdeposit</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cdeposit &lt;amount&gt; &lt;money&gt;
cdeposit all &lt;money&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>cdeposit 5 gold
cdeposit 20 sp
cdeposit all iron
</pre>
<p>Puts money from your purse into your clan's treasury. Name the coins: 
iron, copper, silver, gold or platinum, or ip, cp, sp, gp, pp for short. 
With all, every coin of that kind you carry goes in.
</p><p>Any member of the clan can deposit, but only at the clan chest in the clan 
house. Only the clan Master and the treasurers can take money out again (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cwithdraw</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cbalance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cwithdraw</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>